    narr:narration """The narrative's frame asks what ridership evidence justifies moving a late sailing and which days it separates. Its single supporting position, [the weekday cut with the weekend timetable left alone](narr:Position_FerryLateSailingWeekdayVsWeekend), carries both halves: the reduction on weekdays from [November](narr:Position_FerryLateSailingWeekdayVsWeekend), and the claim that [Friday](narr:Position_FerryLateSailingWeekdayVsWeekend) and [Saturday](narr:Position_FerryLateSailingWeekdayVsWeekend) late sailings still fill. With one position beneath it, the narrative holds no recorded tension yet — the frame's question about which days the evidence separates remains open rather than concluded.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_FerryLateSailingWeekdayVsWeekend> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "The last ferry moves from 22:40 to 21:55 on weekdays from November. The late sailing carried under ten passengers a night." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_FerryLateSailingWeekdayVsWeekend> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "The weekend timetable stays as it is; Friday and Saturday late sailings still fill." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_FerryLateSailingWeekdayVsWeekend> ] ;
